    <h1>Project Aequora: A Proposal for Universal Integration</h1>

    <h2>Executive Summary</h2>
    <p>This proposal outlines a groundbreaking research initiative focused on developing adaptive smart-home ecosystems and autonomous urban navigation systems designed to empower individuals with diverse physical and cognitive disabilities. Our goal is to move beyond basic accessibility compliance toward a future where technology seamlessly integrates with human needs, effectively creating an inclusive environment akin to the utopian vision often cited in literature.</p>

